  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After Unit Two finally hands over its genuine red-carpet plan, Xingzi, Kaiwen, and Chun Yuqiao spot a dangerous pairing: two sharp-tongued commentators with a bitter four-year feud. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大，二部的真正方案我已经拿到了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我就跟他们说，如果不给我，我自己也有办法拿到。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "也行，先看看里面的内容。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "红毯评论员请了两位名嘴碰头，也算是有想法。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这两个人有旧怨，四年前闹得满街都是新闻。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "对，那会儿网上传得特别火。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "两个人当场互相吵了五分钟，主播的耳机都被打掉了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "都过去这么多年了，现在不会有问题了吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "四年了，这两个人从来都没有同过台。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "去告诉二部，让他们马上换人。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大，二部的真正方案我已经拿到了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, I got hold of Unit Two's real red-carpet proposal.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我就跟他们说，如果不给我，我自己也有办法拿到。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I told them if they refused to hand it over, I had my own way to get it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "也行，先看看里面的内容。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Fair enough; let us check what is inside first.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "红毯评论员请了两位名嘴碰头，也算是有想法。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They booked two famous commentators together for the red carpet; quite an idea.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这两个人有旧怨，四年前闹得满街都是新闻。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Those two have old bad blood; four years ago their spat was all over the news.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "对，那会儿网上传得特别火。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right, the clip went viral online back then.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "两个人当场互相吵了五分钟，主播的耳机都被打掉了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The two traded barbs onstage for five minutes and knocked off the anchor's earpiece.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "都过去这么多年了，现在不会有问题了吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'After all these years, surely there will not be trouble now?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "四年了，这两个人从来都没有同过台。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In four full years, those two have never once shared a stage.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "去告诉二部，让他们马上换人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Go tell Unit Two to replace them immediately.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大，二部的真正方案我已经拿到了。",
